      N17: "Assumes that bitcoin purchases appreciates or depreciates a half year and the bitcoin bought in previous year appreciates or depreciates a full year. Note that today bitcoin is treated as an intangible asset and can only be market down, not up. Tesla could still sell the bitcoin for its cash value. This line is meant to calculate bitcoin's value for future years, so the 2023 value may differ from actual to date. The 2023 valuation was made using the price as of 11 June 2024.",
